        <id>https://youngforest.github.io/en/2018/03/27/latex-problems/</id>
        <title>Problems Encountered While Using LaTeX</title>
        <link rel="alternate" href="https://youngforest.github.io/en/2018/03/27/latex-problems/"/>
        <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;I used LaTeX to write my graduation thesis and encountered many problems. I summarize them here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;PDF-Cannot-Display-Correctly&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#PDF-Cannot-Display-Correctly&#34; class=&#34;headerlink&#34; title=&#34;PDF Cannot Display Correctly&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;PDF Cannot Display Correctly&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;Problem-Description&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#Problem-Description&#34; class=&#34;headerlink&#34; title=&#34;Problem Description&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Problem Description&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;A document successfully compiled with XeLaTeX could not correctly display PDF images; it showed a blank area instead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;Cause&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#Cause&#34; class=&#34;headerlink&#34; title=&#34;Cause&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://tieba.baidu.com/p/4191389769?traceid=&#34;&gt;Cause&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The PDF file version was the problem. Its version was 1.7, while XeLaTeX compiles as 1.5 by default.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;Solution&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;#Solution&#34; class=&#34;headerlink&#34; title=&#34;Solution&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Solution&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;For &lt;code&gt;xelatex %.tex&lt;/code&gt;, add &lt;code&gt;--output-driver=&amp;quot;xdvipdfmx -V7&amp;quot;&lt;/code&gt;. That is, modify &lt;code&gt;msmake.bat&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;figure class=&#34;highlight bash&#34;&gt;&lt;table&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;gutter&#34;&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;code&#34;&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;xelatex %mythesis%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;comment&#34;&gt;# =&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;xelatex --output-driver=&lt;span class=&#34;string&#34;&gt;&amp;quot;xdvipdfmx -V7&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt; %mythesis%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
</content>
